{
  "id": "fb-pride-prejudice",
  "title": "Pride and Prejudice",
  "sourceTitle": "Pride and Prejudice",
  "kind": "book",
  "synopsis": "Longbourn, regency England. A single man in possession of a good fortune is in want of a wife. Your mother is, somehow, aware of every such man in the county.",
  "releaseYear": 1813,
  "addedAt": "2026-03-01T00:00:00Z",
  "genre": "Drama",
  "tags": [
    "austen",
    "marriage",
    "wit"
  ],
  "rating": null,
  "loved": false,
  "nextStoryId": null,
  "startNodeId": "s1",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "s1",
      "text": "Bingley has taken Netherfield. Mama is, immediately, planning.",
      "sceneTitle": "Netherfield Lets",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Indulge her",
          "consequence": "Civil.",
          "nextNodeId": "s2"
        },
        {
          "text": "Tease her",
          "consequence": "Spirit.",
          "nextNodeId": "s2"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s2",
      "text": "Bingley is amiable. His friend Darcy is, instantly, insufferable.",
      "sceneTitle": "Meryton Assembly",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Be amused by him",
          "consequence": "Wit.",
          "nextNodeId": "s3"
        },
        {
          "text": "Be wounded",
          "consequence": "Honest.",
          "nextNodeId": "s3"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s3",
      "text": "Darcy says you are tolerable but not handsome enough to tempt him. Charlotte overhears.",
      "sceneTitle": "Tolerable",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Laugh it off",
          "consequence": "Pride.",
          "nextNodeId": "s4"
        },
        {
          "text": "File it away",
          "consequence": "Honest.",
          "nextNodeId": "s4"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s4",
      "text": "Jane is sent to Netherfield in the rain. She catches cold.",
      "sceneTitle": "Jane and Bingley",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Walk to nurse her",
          "consequence": "Sister.",
          "nextNodeId": "s5"
        },
        {
          "text": "Wait",
          "consequence": "Modesty.",
          "nextNodeId": "s5"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s5",
      "text": "You arrive at Netherfield, muddy. The Bingley sisters notice.",
      "sceneTitle": "Muddy Petticoats",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Ignore them",
          "consequence": "Spirit.",
          "nextNodeId": "s6"
        },
        {
          "text": "Apologize",
          "consequence": "Civil.",
          "nextNodeId": "s6"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s6",
      "text": "He watches you across rooms. You assume the worst of him.",
      "sceneTitle": "Darcy in the Library",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Stay sharp with him",
          "consequence": "Spirit.",
          "nextNodeId": "s7"
        },
        {
          "text": "Be curious",
          "consequence": "Honest.",
          "nextNodeId": "s7"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s7",
      "text": "A cousin, awful, proposes. He will inherit Longbourn.",
      "sceneTitle": "Mr. Collins",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Refuse",
          "consequence": "Self.",
          "nextNodeId": "s8"
        },
        {
          "text": "Marry him",
          "consequence": "Family.",
          "nextNodeId": "s8"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s8",
      "text": "Your friend marries him. You are, at first, hurt.",
      "sceneTitle": "Charlotte",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Understand her",
          "consequence": "Honor.",
          "nextNodeId": "s9"
        },
        {
          "text": "Judge her",
          "consequence": "Pride.",
          "nextNodeId": "s9"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s9",
      "text": "A charming officer. He tells you Darcy ruined him.",
      "sceneTitle": "Wickham",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Believe him",
          "consequence": "Sympathetic.",
          "nextNodeId": "s10"
        },
        {
          "text": "Doubt him",
          "consequence": "Wise.",
          "nextNodeId": "s10"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s10",
      "text": "You visit Charlotte. Lady Catherine de Bourgh is, somehow, much.",
      "sceneTitle": "Hunsford",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Endure",
          "consequence": "Civil.",
          "nextNodeId": "s11"
        },
        {
          "text": "Spar",
          "consequence": "Spirit.",
          "nextNodeId": "s11"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s11",
      "text": "He proposes, against his will. He is, in proposing, awful.",
      "sceneTitle": "Darcy's Proposal",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Refuse him",
          "consequence": "Honor.",
          "nextNodeId": "s12"
        },
        {
          "text": "Hesitate",
          "consequence": "Honest.",
          "nextNodeId": "s12"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s12",
      "text": "He writes you a letter. Wickham is, in fact, a scoundrel.",
      "sceneTitle": "The Letter",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Reread it",
          "consequence": "Wise.",
          "nextNodeId": "s13"
        },
        {
          "text": "Burn it",
          "consequence": "Pride.",
          "nextNodeId": "s13"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s13",
      "text": "You tour, by chance. The house is, mortifyingly, lovely.",
      "sceneTitle": "Pemberley",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Admire it",
          "consequence": "Honest.",
          "nextNodeId": "s14"
        },
        {
          "text": "Mock it",
          "consequence": "Pride.",
          "nextNodeId": "s14"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s14",
      "text": "He returns early. He is, against expectation, kind.",
      "sceneTitle": "Darcy, Surprised",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Be civil",
          "consequence": "Civil.",
          "nextNodeId": "s15"
        },
        {
          "text": "Be flustered",
          "consequence": "Honest.",
          "nextNodeId": "s15"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s15",
      "text": "Your youngest sister has run off with Wickham.",
      "sceneTitle": "Lydia's Elopement",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Hurry home",
          "consequence": "Family.",
          "nextNodeId": "s16"
        },
        {
          "text": "Stay calm",
          "consequence": "Civil.",
          "nextNodeId": "s16"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s16",
      "text": "He, secretly, arranges the marriage and pays Wickham's debts.",
      "sceneTitle": "Mr. Darcy Acts",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Suspect him gratefully",
          "consequence": "Honor.",
          "nextNodeId": "s17"
        },
        {
          "text": "Suspect uncle",
          "consequence": "Naive.",
          "nextNodeId": "s17"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s17",
      "text": "She demands you promise not to marry her nephew.",
      "sceneTitle": "Lady Catherine Visits",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Refuse to promise",
          "consequence": "Spirit.",
          "nextNodeId": "s18"
        },
        {
          "text": "Pretend",
          "consequence": "Strategy.",
          "nextNodeId": "s18"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s18",
      "text": "Darcy proposes again. Differently.",
      "sceneTitle": "Walk Out",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Accept",
          "consequence": "Heart.",
          "nextNodeId": "s19"
        },
        {
          "text": "Confess your error first",
          "consequence": "Honor.",
          "nextNodeId": "s19"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s19",
      "text": "Mama, hearing, almost faints with joy.",
      "sceneTitle": "Mother",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Tolerate",
          "consequence": "Family.",
          "nextNodeId": "s20"
        },
        {
          "text": "Calm her",
          "consequence": "Patient.",
          "nextNodeId": "s20"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s20",
      "text": "A double wedding for Jane and you. Darcy stands tall. Bingley smiles.",
      "sceneTitle": "Wedding",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Take Darcy's hand",
          "consequence": "Path.",
          "nextNodeId": "s21"
        },
        {
          "text": "Take Jane's hand first",
          "consequence": "Sister.",
          "nextNodeId": "s21"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "s21",
      "text": "You walk the library with the master of it. The shelves are higher than the house in Hertfordshire.",
      "sceneTitle": "Pemberley, Yours",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Read often",
          "consequence": "Joy.",
          "nextNodeId": "end_pemberley"
        },
        {
          "text": "Manage the estate",
          "consequence": "Duty.",
          "nextNodeId": "end_sister"
        },
        {
          "text": "Take the third path",
          "consequence": "Some endings reveal themselves last.",
          "nextNodeId": "end_writer"
        }
      ],
      "isEnding": false,
      "endingTitle": null
    },
    {
      "id": "end_pemberley",
      "text": "You manage Pemberley with grace. The Darcy heirs are, mercifully, more like their father than your mother. Lady Catherine, eventually, visits.",
      "sceneTitle": "Mistress of Pemberley",
      "choices": [],
      "isEnding": true,
      "endingTitle": "Mistress of Pemberley"
    },
    {
      "id": "end_sister",
      "text": "Jane and you live within a day's ride. Your children grow up together. You are, in middle age, sometimes silly with her in the way of girls in a sitting room.",
      "sceneTitle": "Both Sisters",
      "choices": [],
      "isEnding": true,
      "endingTitle": "Both Sisters"
    },
    {
      "id": "end_writer",
      "text": "You write, late in life, a quiet anonymous novel about a country family with too many daughters. It does, surprisingly, well.",
      "sceneTitle": "Writer",
      "choices": [],
      "isEnding": true,
      "endingTitle": "Writer"
    }
  ]
}
